OL,3,GNEWSAOrca found in Uist 'one of oldest
OL,4,Amales ever recorded' say scientists
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists believe a killer whale found
OL,7,Fdead in the Western Isles is one of the
OL,8,Foldest male orcas ever recorded
OL,9,Ffollowing analysis of its teeth.
OL,11,FThe animal, discovered on a shoreline
OL,12,Fon South Uist in 2015, is thought to
OL,13,Fhave been 65 years old or older.
OL,15,FA Scottish team of researchers studied
OL,16,Fthe ringed layers that formed annually
OL,17,Fin one of its teeth.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
