OL,3,GNEWSAOrca found in Uist 'one of oldest
OL,4,Amales ever recorded' say scientists
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe researchers said a clue to the
OL,7,Forca's age was the absence of traces of
OL,8,Fradioactive fallout from atmospheric
OL,9,Fnuclear weapons tests, conducted near
OL,10,Foceans in the mid-20th Century, in the
OL,11,Foldest layers of the tooth.
